@format 1
@id export.save-presets
@title Export preset
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Write the current tab-specific export preset as one standalone JSON file.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge
@flow TB
@related export.load-presets

@alias export = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PExport

[input] Export presets requested <input>
- Show a save-file dialog for the preset collection @ export.PExportPresetSave(...)
> choose

[choose] Choose destination <decision>
? "Dialog is cancelled" > unchanged
? "A path is selected" > write

[write] Write preset file <storage>
- Serialize the current tab-specific preset record to the selected path @ export.PExportPresetSave(...)
> result

[result] Presets exported <output>
= A standalone preset JSON file exists at the selected path.

[unchanged] Export cancelled <output>
= No file is written.
